    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawking Shopworker"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's raining so hard out there. Why not come inside, have a pot of nice, warm tea, and wait out the rain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawking Shopworker"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need. This rain won't be stopping anytime soon\u2014I should keep moving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. Some people want the rain to stop, some hope it carries on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawking Shopworker"
    },
    {
        "text": "The umbrella vendor is smiling from ear to ear, but the passersby are downright miserable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawking Shopworker"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fascinating thought...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friend, you should take a moment to rest. I was asked to remind you: the road ahead is rough and uneven. A certain someone worries you might misstep, and get your shoes wet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawking Shopworker"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Calm Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Please just follow me, sir. Your friend is already waiting for you inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawking Shopworker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "35_g13_yanlivingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
