        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "High Minister... it's been a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... These days, you're... the Grand Tutor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.5,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has been some time indeed, since we bid each other farewell in Yumen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I expected to meet with the Sui Regulator and the Ministry of War first upon this return to the capital to deliver my report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I've arranged to meet with you in advance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "His Imperial Majesty... has passed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_thunders_amb",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "When?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two weeks ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think... if His Majesty had died of natural causes, you would not be coming to see me about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does this mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "200,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5,
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man sitting in the shadows holds out his hand. A black weiqi stone rests in his palm."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sixty years ago, he escaped from that ancient temple and turned himself into one hundred eighty-one black weiqi stones, which scattered across the lands. Their current whereabouts are unknown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two weeks ago, the Sui Regulator found this stone in the capital.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What... has he done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing I'm certain of is that he could not have entered the Forbidden City... someone must have gone out to meet him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Investigating this person's identity would be... sensitive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "His machinations likely will not involve others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shouldn't have come to you today, but when the convict caused all this turmoil before, you were the one who subdued him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grandmaster, do you know anything of this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a thing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have not seen him, since the incident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I believe you, Grandmaster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you need anything from me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not linger here. Return to Yumen at once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ursus is in constant turmoil, and there is a changing of the guard in Yumen. We must not allow morale to be shaken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will handle the Sui Regulator and the Ministry of War myself. It is precisely because you are not entangled in this affair that I can entrust you with such a crucial task.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will see the Sui Regulator continue to investigate the weiqi matter in secret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "text": "During this crucial time, you should remain out of sight, Grandmaster. We did not meet here today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regarding the True Lung... how is His Highness Yan Wu?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this moment, he should be\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shuo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yan Wu...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_301_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yan Wu was the one who went to His Imperial Majesty... on the night he died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Tutor"
    },
    {
