    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-30",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Highness, twenty-eight members of the traitor's family have been imprisoned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But after we checked the list, we found there was a single individual missing\u2014an infant just under a month old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Imperial Guard searched the Grand Preceptor's mansion thoroughly today, but found no traces of the baby.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "A newborn could not have run off by herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone went through the trouble to whisk her away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Highness need not worry. The Imperial Guard will find her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Earlier today, the Minister of Justice requested a meeting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "He seeks His Highness's advice on this series of cases.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Handle them... according to the Laws of Yan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll tell him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is my elder brother now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to our reports, he left the capital just half an hour ago. Some of the Imperial Guard have defected with him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The soldiers guarding the city did not dare to stop them, without orders to do so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed... I never ordered them to keep him in Baizao.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was unwilling to stay and left everyone behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many Imperial Guardsmen went with him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eighteen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even after committing such an unforgivable crime, my elder brother can still send the Grand Preceptor to die in his place; he can still command the unwavering loyalty of these eighteen deathsworn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many courtiers are still devoted to him? How many still hope that he will retake the throne?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet it is Your Highness who now sits on the throne, not him. Therefore, it falls upon Your Highness to ensure Yan's eternal prosperity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "All castes of Yan may afford hesitation and uncertainty... save Your Highness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been so long since I've left this palace... Grand Commandant, tell me\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has the spring rain yet ceased, in Baizao?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The rain may stop whenever Your Highness desires.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Your Highness has changed your mind, you yet have time to stop them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm exhausted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Imperial Kitchen has prepared some babao soup and shredded bamboo shoots. If Your Highness desires?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Behind the Curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1239_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grand Commandant"
    },
