        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahhh! Ahhh!! What the\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coachman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "b",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pcknmgrwl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Yanese exclamation* What's somebody doing out here in the wilderness at this hour?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coachman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1616_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man looks around, but the endless rain blocks his view. It is too dark for him to see anything."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1616_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have to get out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_goldcoin",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I'll give you all the money I have. Take your carriage to the next stage station. If anyone asks, do not tell them you carried passengers with a baby tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I beseech you, good sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "But.... what... huh?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coachman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going in this weather?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Coachman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1616_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll follow the path through the northern woods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahhhh!!!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1616_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The baby...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "The baby is gone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1616_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anxious Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
