    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$midautumn",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's... it's her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The baby is sleeping soundly in her cradle, oblivious to the mud and blood on her face."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#2$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did everything you asked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know their methods, and I know how to answer them. Don't worry. I won't allow any blood to stain you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good sir, I have no way to repay your kindness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. You need not thank me. I did not do this for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's done so much for me, yet what I do today will neither clear her name nor even begin to avenge her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no family and no affairs to settle after my death. I ask only one favor of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, take this girl in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need not tell her anything. Just let her grow up and live her life in peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know... if she stays here, it will be risky, with a greater possibility that this old case will be reopened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "But isn't that what you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "We may be powerless to change the situation right now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if one day, be it three or four decades later, the truth is revealed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the blood shall not have been shed in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Man with Bloody Hands"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1614_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right then. I swear it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Silent Old Man"
    },
